> Written with AI (OpenAI Codex).

Here we are, blog number four.

UI design has never been my strong suit. Getting a page to work is one thing; making it look good usually leaves me stuck.

So, a small thank-you to AI. With its help, even I managed to make a page with a little bit of design to it. Nothing fancy, but I like looking at it. That makes me happy.

## Still like Markdoc

Still like Markdoc, so it's here too. A `.mdoc` file, a title, and some words. A comfortable way to write.

## The swallow is still here

![Swallows in flight](/assets/swallow.svg)

The swallow from the first blog made it into this version too. It still flies.

The site is ready again. Time to put something in it.
